cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PyAPS in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
  A version-specific archival DOI (via Zenodo) will be added here once the
  first tagged release is public.
title: PyAPS
type: software
abstract: >-
  Python-based Advance Processing System for WEAVE: a platform for
  processing and analysing WEAVE survey spectroscopic data (MOS, mIFU, and
  LIFU observing modes), developed as part of the WEAVE Science Processing
  and Archive (SPA) system.
authors:
  - name: "WEAVE APS Team"
  - given-names: Alireza
    family-names: Molaeinezhad
    email: amolaei@ast.cam.ac.uk
    affiliation: >-
      CAMCEAD, Institute of Astronomy, University of Cambridge
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/amolaeinezhad/PyAPS"
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-29"
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - spectroscopy
  - WEAVE
  - survey
  - data analysis
